      "message": "This seems like a lot of code/config in Gerrit for a problem that seems like it could be solved by the user adding their preferred email to the avatar lookup service. Am I missing something here?",
      "revId": "50f981d7d2123adb2be2243a5ff946a2c8dc0320",
